# Nano-Magnetic Materials

**Authors:** 

## Abstract
<jats:p>The utilization of traditional magnetic materials and magnetic composite materials have been developing quickly in recent decades. The build of magnetic properties has been created, with pursuing the inclusion of a few diverse nanoparticles to formulate magnetic nanocomposite crystalline core. This chapter contains theories and characterization of magnetic nanocomposites that are compared with variant traditional magnetic materials. Finally, this chapter sheds light on regulations, forecast, and recommendations for manufactures for using new multi-nanocomposites magnetic materials in electrical applications. </jats:p>

